docs {
  Expected: 501 Problem Details. Ex parte is the same MAGI determination
  the medicaid graph already computes, via a different evidentiary pathway
  (electronic checks + a conclusiveness gate). Implementation awaits
  contract clarification of the per-service result schemas and household
  context — see docs/contract-gap-analysis.md ("Medicaid ex parte"). The
  v2 draft contract specifies the endpoint fully: /v2/eligibility/docs.
}
